            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Spencer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made a minor adjustment to this recipe and came out with really scrumptious cookies. Instead of using all cake flour, I subbed 2/3 for almond flour. Baking time should be extended to at least 15 mins because of this. My cookies have varying shades of color because of the oil I used. One pan was greased with salted butter, yielding lighter cookies, and the other was greased with grape seed oil. All tasted amazing!",
